#: data/io.github.ailing2416.sentinel.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Sentinel is a native GNOME SSH connection manager focused on security and "
"aesthetics. It integrates with password managers like Bitwarden to keep your "
"credentials safe."
